  "notes": "Primarily used with wars, conflicts, revolutions, and major crises. Carries a sense of sudden, dramatic eruption — not used for minor incidents or everyday events.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{戦争|せんそう}が{勃発|ぼっぱつ}する — a war breaks out\n・{紛争|ふんそう}が{勃発|ぼっぱつ}する — a conflict breaks out\n・{内戦|ないせん}の{勃発|ぼっぱつ} — outbreak of civil war\n・{革命|かくめい}が{勃発|ぼっぱつ}する — a revolution breaks out",
